/*QUAKED turret_blaster (1 .6 .2) (-8 -8 -8) (8 8 8)
 Fires blaster bolts along the view of whoever uses it, and credits them with the kill.

 -------- Keys --------
 angles : The direction fired in. Use -1 for up, -2 for down.
 dmg : The damage inflicted per projectile (default varies by weapon).
 knockback : The knockback applied per projectile (default varies by weapon).
 speed : The projectile speed in units per second (default varies by weapon).
 spread : The cone of fire, from 0.0 for pinpoint to 1.0 for wild (default 0).
 target : An entity to aim at, re-evaluated on every shot. Overrides "angles".
 targetname : The target name of this entity.
 wait : The minimum interval in seconds between shots (default 1.0).

 -------- Notes --------
 Surround it with a trigger_multiple that targets it, and players who step in behind it will
 operate it. Projectiles leave the turret, not the player, but carry the player's colors and
 are credited to them.

 The operator cannot be struck by their own projectiles, but the rocket, grenade and BFG types
 still splash them, so leave room behind the turret.

 Give the trigger_multiple a short "wait" for sustained fire while the player stands
 in it.
*/

